      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       000-PROGRAMA-PRINCIPAL.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           PERFORM   100-INICIALIZA   THRU   100-FIM.
      *
           PERFORM   200-FORMATACAO-REGISTRO   THRU   200-FIM.
      *
           PERFORM   220-VERIFICA-SUCESSO   THRU   220-FIM
      *
           IF   SUCESSO
             MOVE   ZEROS   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
           ELSE
             PERFORM   300-ETAPA-II   THRU   300-FIM
             PERFORM   220-VERIFICA-SUCESSO   THRU   220-FIM
             IF   SUCESSO
               MOVE   ZEROS   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
             ELSE
               IF   WS-FLAG-PASSOS   NOT EQUAL   WS-INSUCESSO
                 PERFORM   230-VERIFICA-OPERACAO-IDENTICA
                   THRU   230-FIM
               END-IF
               IF   SUCESSO
                 MOVE   ZEROS   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
               ELSE
                 IF   RUCLS-QT-CONTAS OF RUCLS-LISTA  GREATER   ZEROS
                   MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
                   MOVE   'MAIS DE UMA CONTA ATENDE AOS CRITERIOS'
                     TO   RUCLS-DENOTER
                 ELSE
                   MOVE   01   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
                   MOVE   'NAO FOI POSSIVEL IDENTIFICAR A OPERACAO'
                     TO   RUCLS-DENOTER
                 END-IF
               END-IF
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       900-SAIDA.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           GOBACK.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *000-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       100-INICIALIZA.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           INITIALIZE   RUCLS-LISTA.
           MOVE   01   TO   RUCWS-ACAO.
           MOVE   WS-INSUCESSO  TO   WS-FLAG-PASSOS.
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO
             RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF.
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO
             RUCLS-CO-PRODUTO   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF.
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO
             RUCLS-NU-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF.
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO
             RUCLS-NU-DV-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF.
           MOVE   ZEROS          TO   WS-PASSO-AUX
                                      WS-FLAG-FIM-LOOP.
      *
           IF   RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   NOT
             NUMERIC   OR
                RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   EQUAL
             ZEROS
             MOVE   01   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
             MOVE   'NU-CGC-UNIDADE CONTA-BB NAO NUMERICO'   TO
               RUCLS-DENOTER
             PERFORM   900-SAIDA
           END-IF
           MOVE   RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   TO
             WS-AGENCIA
             RUCWS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE.
           IF   RUCLS-NU-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   NOT
             NUMERIC   OR
                RUCLS-NU-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   EQUAL
             ZEROS
             MOVE   01   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
             MOVE   'NU-CONTA CONTA-BB NAO NUMERICO'   TO
               RUCLS-DENOTER
             PERFORM   900-SAIDA
           END-IF.
           MOVE   RUCLS-NU-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   TO
             WS-CONTA-CEF.
           IF   RUCLS-NU-DV-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   NOT
             NUMERIC
             MOVE   01   TO   RUCLS-RETORNO
             MOVE   'NU-DV-CONTA CONTA-BB NAO NUMERICO'   TO
               RUCLS-DENOTER
             PERFORM  900-SAIDA
           ELSE
             MOVE   RUCLS-NU-DV-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-BB   TO
               WS-DIGITO-VERIFICADOR
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       100-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       200-FORMATACAO-REGISTRO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           SET   WS-PASSO   TO   01
           MOVE   06   TO   WS-LENGTH
           SET   WS-PASSO-AUX   TO   WS-PASSO
      *
           PERFORM   UNTIL   WS-LENGTH   GREATER   008   OR
             WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )   EQUAL   '1'
             MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF( 1:(12 - WS-LENGTH ))   TO
               WS-CO-PRODUTO
             MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF( (12 - WS-LENGTH + 1 ): WS-LENGTH )
               TO   WS-NU-CONTA
      *
             IF   WS-NU-CONTA   GREATER   ZEROS  AND
                  WS-CO-PRODUTO GREATER   ZEROS
      *
               MOVE   WS-CO-PRODUTO   TO   WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO
               IF   WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO   GREATER   ZEROS
                 PERFORM   210-VALIDA-OPERACAO   THRU   210-FIM
      *
                 IF   WS-OPERACAO-VALIDA
                   MOVE   WS-CO-PRODUTO   TO   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )
                   MOVE   WS-NU-CONTA   TO   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )
                   PERFORM   215-CALCULA-DV   THRU   215-FIM
                   IF   RUCWS-DV-CONTA   EQUAL   WS-DIGITO-VERIFICADOR
                     MOVE   '1'   TO   WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )
                   END-IF
                 END-IF
               END-IF
             END-IF
             ADD   +1   TO   WS-LENGTH
      *
           END-PERFORM.
      *
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       200-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       210-VALIDA-OPERACAO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO   WS-FLAG-OPERACAO-VALIDA
           IF   RUCLS-CONTA-INVESTIMENTO   NOT EQUAL   'S'
             MOVE   WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO   TO   WS-CONTA-CONVENCIONAL
             IF   WS-VALUE-CONVENCIONAL
               MOVE   1   TO   WS-FLAG-OPERACAO-VALIDA
             ELSE
               IF   WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO   EQUAL   050   AND
                    WS-AGENCIA   EQUAL   0238
                 MOVE   1   TO   WS-FLAG-OPERACAO-VALIDA
               END-IF
             END-IF
           ELSE
             MOVE   WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO   TO   WS-CONTA-INVESTIMENTO
             IF   WS-VALUE-INVESTIMENTO
               MOVE   1   TO   WS-FLAG-OPERACAO-VALIDA
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       210-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       215-CALCULA-DV.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           MOVE   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )   TO   RUCWS-CO-OPERACAO.
           MOVE   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )   TO   RUCWS-NU-CONTA.
      *
           IF   RUCLS-AMBIENTE   EQUAL   'B'
             CALL   RUCBBDIG
               USING
                 RUCWSDIG
             END-CALL
           ELSE
             CALL   RUCBBDIG
               USING
                 LS-RUNTIME-PARM1
                 LS-RUNTIME-PARM2
                 RUCWSDIG
             END-CALL
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE   RUCWS-DV-CONTA   TO   WS-DV-CONTA( WS-PASSO ).
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       215-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       220-VERIFICA-SUCESSO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           PERFORM   VARYING   WS-PASSO-AUX   FROM   1   BY   1
             UNTIL   WS-PASSO-AUX   GREATER   015   OR
             SUCESSO
      *
             IF   WS-PASSOS( WS-PASSO-AUX )   EQUAL
               WS-FLAG-PASSOS
               MOVE   WS-AGENCIA   TO
                 RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
               MOVE   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO-AUX )   TO
                 RUCLS-CO-PRODUTO   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
                MOVE   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO-AUX )   TO
                  RUCLS-NU-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
               MOVE   WS-DV-CONTA( WS-PASSO-AUX )   TO
                 RUCLS-NU-DV-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
               MOVE   1   TO   WS-FLAG-SUCESSO
             END-IF
      *
           END-PERFORM.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       220-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       230-VERIFICA-OPERACAO-IDENTICA.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           PERFORM   VARYING   WS-PASSO-AUX   FROM   1   BY   1
             UNTIL   WS-PASSO-AUX   GREATER   019   OR   FIM-LOOP
      *
             IF   WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )   EQUAL   '1'
               MOVE   WS-PASSO-AUX   TO   WS-PASSO-COM-SUCESSO
               IF    WS-OPERACAO-AUX   EQUAL   ZERO
                   MOVE   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO-AUX )   TO
                     WS-OPERACAO-AUX
               ELSE
                 IF   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO-AUX )   NOT EQUAL
                   WS-OPERACAO-AUX
                   MOVE   '1'   TO   WS-FLAG-FIM-LOOP
                 END-IF
               END-IF
               IF    WS-CONTA-AUX   EQUAL   ZERO
                   MOVE   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO-AUX )   TO
                     WS-CONTA-AUX
               ELSE
                 IF   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO-AUX )   NOT EQUAL
                   WS-CONTA-AUX
                   MOVE   '1'   TO   WS-FLAG-FIM-LOOP
                 END-IF
               END-IF
             END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
      *
           IF   NOT   FIM-LOOP
             MOVE   WS-AGENCIA   TO
               RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
             MOVE   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO-COM-SUCESSO )   TO
               RUCLS-CO-PRODUTO   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
              MOVE   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO-COM-SUCESSO )   TO
                RUCLS-NU-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
             MOVE   WS-DV-CONTA( WS-PASSO-COM-SUCESSO )   TO
               RUCLS-NU-DV-CONTA   OF   RUCLS-CONTA-CEF
             MOVE   1   TO   WS-FLAG-SUCESSO
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       230-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       240-MOVE-CONTA.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           IF   RUCLS-QT-CONTAS   LESS  20
             ADD   +1   TO   RUCLS-QT-CONTAS
             MOVE   WS-AGENCIA
               TO   RUCLS-NU-CGC-UNIDADE
                      OF RUCLS-CONTAS ( RUCLS-QT-CONTAS )
             MOVE   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )
               TO   RUCLS-CO-PRODUTO OF RUCLS-CONTAS ( RUCLS-QT-CONTAS )
             MOVE   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )
               TO   RUCLS-NU-CONTA OF RUCLS-CONTAS ( RUCLS-QT-CONTAS )
             MOVE   RUCWS-DV-CONTA
               TO   RUCLS-NU-DV-CONTA OF RUCLS-CONTAS( RUCLS-QT-CONTAS )
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       240-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       300-ETAPA-II.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                          F A S E   I
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           IF   WS-CONTA-CEF   LESS   100000000
             IF   RUCLS-CONTA-INVESTIMENTO   EQUAL   'S'
               PERFORM   VARYING   WS-INDICE-INVESTIMENTO
                 FROM   1   BY   1
                 UNTIL   WS-INDICE-INVESTIMENTO   GREATER   06
                 SET   WS-PASSO   UP   BY   1
                 MOVE   WS-OPERACAO-AGREGADA OF WS-TABELA-INVESTIMENTO
                        ( WS-INDICE-INVESTIMENTO )
                   TO   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )
                 MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF   TO
                   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )
                 PERFORM   215-CALCULA-DV   THRU   215-FIM
                 IF   RUCWS-DV-CONTA   EQUAL   WS-DIGITO-VERIFICADOR
                   SET   WS-PASSO-AUX   TO   WS-PASSO
                   MOVE   '1'   TO   WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )
                   PERFORM   240-MOVE-CONTA   THRU   240-FIM
                 END-IF
               END-PERFORM
             ELSE
               SET   WS-PASSO   TO   1
               SET   WS-PASSO   UP   BY   -1
               PERFORM   VARYING   WS-INDICE   FROM   1   BY   1
                 UNTIL   WS-INDICE    GREATER   19
                 SET   WS-PASSO   UP   BY   1
                 MOVE   WS-OPERACAO-AGREGADA OF WS-TABELA-OPERACOES
                        ( WS-INDICE )
                   TO   WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )
                 MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF   TO
                   WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )
                 PERFORM   215-CALCULA-DV   THRU   215-FIM
                 IF   RUCWS-DV-CONTA   EQUAL   WS-DIGITO-VERIFICADOR
                   SET   WS-PASSO-AUX   TO   WS-PASSO
                   MOVE   '1'   TO   WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )
                   PERFORM   240-MOVE-CONTA   THRU   240-FIM
                 END-IF
               END-PERFORM
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                          F A S E   I I
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO   WS-POSITION  WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS.

           SET   WS-PASSO   TO   1.
           SET   WS-PASSO   UP   BY   -1 .

           PERFORM  VARYING WS-POSITION FROM  1  BY 1
                    UNTIL   WS-POSITION  GREATER 12

                       OR   WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS  GREATER   ZEROS
      *        ADD   +1   TO   WS-POSITION
               MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF( 1:WS-POSITION)    TO
                                     WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS
           END-PERFORM.

           SET   WS-PASSO   UP   BY   1 .

           IF  WS-POSITION LESS 11
               COMPUTE   WS-STARTING-POSITION = WS-POSITION   +   1
           ELSE
               MOVE 12  TO WS-STARTING-POSITION
           END-IF.

           IF WS-POSITION LESS  11
              COMPUTE   WS-LENGTH = 12 - WS-POSITION
           ELSE
              MOVE 01 TO WS-LENGTH
           END-IF .

           MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF( WS-STARTING-POSITION:WS-LENGTH)   TO
             WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS .
      *
           IF   WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS   LESS   100000000
             IF WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS  GREATER ZEROS
                MOVE   WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS(10:3)  TO
                                                WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )
                MOVE   WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS(7:6)  TO
                                                WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO
                PERFORM   210-VALIDA-OPERACAO   THRU   210-FIM
                IF   WS-OPERACAO-VALIDA
                     MOVE   WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS   TO
                                                WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )
                     PERFORM   215-CALCULA-DV   THRU   215-FIM
                     IF  RUCWS-DV-CONTA   EQUAL   WS-DIGITO-VERIFICADOR
                         SET   WS-PASSO-AUX   TO   WS-PASSO
                         MOVE   '1'   TO
                                    WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )
                         PERFORM   240-MOVE-CONTA   THRU   240-FIM
                     END-IF
                END-IF
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *    SET   WS-PASSO   UP   BY   1
           ADD   +1   TO   WS-POSITION
           IF  WS-POSITION LESS 11
               COMPUTE   WS-STARTING-POSITION = WS-POSITION   +   1
           ELSE
               MOVE 12  TO WS-STARTING-POSITION
           END-IF

           IF WS-POSITION LESS  11
              COMPUTE   WS-LENGTH = 12 - WS-POSITION
           ELSE
              MOVE 01 TO WS-LENGTH
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF( 1:WS-LENGTH )   TO
             WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS

           MOVE   WS-CONTA-CEF( WS-STARTING-POSITION:WS-LENGTH)   TO
             WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS
      *
           IF   WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS   LESS   100000000  AND
                GREATER   ZEROS
             MOVE   WS-MAIS-SIGNIFICATIVOS   TO
               WS-OPERACAO( WS-PASSO )
               WS-VALIDA-OPERACAO
             PERFORM   210-VALIDA-OPERACAO   THRU   210-FIM
             IF   WS-OPERACAO-VALIDA
               MOVE   WS-MENOS-SIGNIFICATIVOS   TO
                 WS-CONTA( WS-PASSO )
               PERFORM   215-CALCULA-DV   THRU   215-FIM
               IF   RUCWS-DV-CONTA   EQUAL   WS-DIGITO-VERIFICADOR
                 SET   WS-PASSO-AUX   TO   WS-PASSO
                 MOVE   '1'   TO   WS-SUCESSO-PASSO( WS-PASSO-AUX )
                 PERFORM   240-MOVE-CONTA   THRU   240-FIM
               END-IF
             END-IF
           END-IF.
